    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n95345" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">Σκῦρος</span></b> , ἡ, the island
		of <u>Scyros</u>, <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b>
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">Σ. αἰπεῖα</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Il.
					9.668
				</span></i>
			:—Adj.
			<b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">Σκύριος</span></b> , <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">α</span>, <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ον</span>,
			<i>of</i> or <i>from Scyros</i>, <i><span class="en">
				Pi.
				<u>Fr.</u>
				106
			</span></i>; <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἀρχὴ Σ.</span>, prov. of a
			useless acquisition, <i><span class="en">
				Lib.
				<u>Ep.</u>
				1200
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				Eust.
				782.52
			</span></i>: <b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">Σκύριος</span></b> , ὁ, a <u>Scyrian</u>, <i><span class="en">
				Hdt.
				7.183
			</span></i>, etc.; <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">Σκυρία δίκη</span>, a
			lawsuit in which the defendant pleaded absence in Scyros, <i><span class="en">
				<u>Com.Adesp.</u>
				902
			</span></i>: <b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">Σκῡρόθεν</span></b> ,
				Adv.
			<i>from Scyros</i>, <i><span class="en">
				Il.
				19.332
			</span></i>.</div>
